    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Franco-Colombian painter and fashion illustrator (b. 1990, Tulua, Colombia), Paris-based since 2019. Studied fashion design (Bogota), photography (Mexico), fashion management (BAU Barcelona). Signature: powerful women in sharp outfits amid nature. Exhibits and sells (oil painting) and illustrates commercially: Adidas, Nike, Netflix, Maison Kitsune, Marie Claire France, Elle Mexico; World Illustration Awards. Agency-repped (MTArt). Mid-senior independent artist, ~10 yrs working since 2014. Autonomy 5: self-directed art practice plus commissions. Freelance per self-maintained site and IG. Country France + Colombia.",
